      "note": "Every pillbug placement and every script-made sprite of sequences 131/133 (foes/pill/f1-w1-, f1-w3-). The photoreal mesh on the existing 43-bone rig with its Idle, Walk and Run clips; gait speeds are the clips' nominal speeds. The original has no attack, hit or death animation for the pillbug: a kill swaps the sprite for the splat 141/143 at once (en-pill.c sp_base_death 140, add_kill_sprite dink.cpp:12359), shown by the burst carcass (shell split, blood across the plates, viscera) and its blood pool until the screen changes; the pool is also projected as a decal so that it stains the grass that hides a flat mesh. A pillbug without base_death (s1-fmons.c, one placement) leaves no carcass: the original plays the blood burst 164 there (dink.cpp:12384-12389, 12412), which no layer draws yet."
